WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:43.130
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:43.400 --> 01:46.900
"The Missing Piece"

3
01:47.100 --> 01:51.800
(Episode 6)

4
01:57.200 --> 01:58.533
Hello Mr. Shen.

5
01:59.400 --> 02:00.400
Hello.

6
02:00.700 --> 02:01.500
My last name is Chen,

7
02:01.633 --> 02:03.733
I'm the lawyer Mr. Ji hired

8
02:04.100 --> 02:04.833
I asked you here today

9
02:04.866 --> 02:05.899
because we need to

10
02:05.900 --> 02:07.633
sort out your contract with Mr. Ji.

11
02:09.066 --> 02:12.500
Ji Mingxuan won't even handle a breakup himself.

12
02:13.000 --> 02:14.633
He just sent a lawyer to talk to me.

13
02:15.733 --> 02:16.733
Maybe

14
02:16.933 --> 02:18.000
to Ji Mingxuan

15
02:18.733 --> 02:20.833
it was just a contract all along.

16
02:21.439 --> 02:22.673
Now that the contract's void,

17
02:23.566 --> 02:25.866
of course it should be settled the proper way.

18
02:29.532 --> 02:32.133
How's Miss Ji doing lately? Do you know?

19
02:32.133 --> 02:33.133
Mm.

20
02:33.333 --> 02:35.466
Her condition is pretty stable now.

21
02:35.633 --> 02:36.633
Seems like

22
02:36.833 --> 02:39.000
Mr. Ji is taking Miss Ji abroad for treatment.

23
02:41.033 --> 02:42.033
It's good that she's stable.

24
02:44.500 --> 02:45.500
Mr. Shen.

25
02:46.059 --> 02:48.693
According to the agreements you signed with Mr. Ji over the years,

26
02:49.419 --> 02:51.253
this is what you should be getting.

27
02:51.446 --> 02:53.279
[Shen Mo is getting MULTIPLE properties as part of the agreement]

28
02:53.433 --> 02:55.533
Mr. Ji is really generous.

29
02:56.300 --> 02:57.900
Mr. Ji is always like that.

30
02:59.566 --> 03:01.566
Ji Mingxuan truly lives up to being a businessman.

31
03:02.033 --> 03:04.700
Even feelings come with a price tag.

32
03:06.100 --> 03:08.400
Should I just sign here?

33
03:08.433 --> 03:08.733
Mm.

34
03:08.733 --> 03:09.433
Yes.

35
03:09.653 --> 03:12.819
Also, Mr. Ji said, if you have any other questions,

36
03:12.843 --> 03:14.219
feel free to bring them up anytime.

37
03:14.300 --> 03:18.732
But this villa is where Miss Ji grew up.

38
03:19.432 --> 03:20.232
I understand.

39
03:20.400 --> 03:21.865
I'll move out in a few days.

40
03:21.866 --> 03:22.866
Mm.

41
03:23.266 --> 03:24.533
Mr. Ji is always generous.

42
03:24.666 --> 03:27.132
Several properties have great layouts.

43
03:27.133 --> 03:28.366
Once the paperwork is done

44
03:28.566 --> 03:30.633
Mr. Shen, you can move back anytime.

45
03:32.400 --> 03:34.666
For someone who got kicked out,

46
03:35.333 --> 03:37.033
I'm staying pretty calm, right?

47
03:37.652 --> 03:38.952
Maybe because...

48
03:39.666 --> 03:42.533
Ji Mingxuan and I never really started.

49
03:43.900 --> 03:44.900
Maybe it's for the best.

50
03:45.633 --> 03:46.633
Oh, right

51
03:46.900 --> 03:49.800
Mr. Ji said the things he gave you back then.

52
03:50.400 --> 03:51.700
Of course they're all yours.

53
03:51.833 --> 03:54.766
But there's one thing he wants back.

54
03:57.833 --> 03:58.833
What is it?

55
03:59.000 --> 04:01.333
It's the house at Jinxiu Mountain Villa.

56
04:02.466 --> 04:03.666
Jinxiu Mountain Villa.

57
04:05.633 --> 04:08.887
Mr. Shen, you're living at the house at Jinxiu Mountain Villa, right?

58
04:09.633 --> 04:11.566
Why bring this up all of a sudden, Mr. Zhao?

59
04:12.433 --> 04:13.433
Nothing.

60
04:13.633 --> 04:14.873
I mistook you for someone else.

61
04:15.566 --> 04:17.526
Mr. Ji insisted on going to Jinxiu Mountain Villa.

62
04:17.833 --> 04:19.700
But the rain last night was so heavy.

63
04:20.733 --> 04:22.733
Mr. Ji was so drunk he couldn't even walk straight.

64
04:23.166 --> 04:24.466
But he still wanted to go.

65
04:25.500 --> 04:28.661
I always thought another lover of Ji Mingxuan lived at Jinxiu Mountain Villa.

66
04:29.433 --> 04:32.433
But now it's somehow property under my name.

67
04:33.833 --> 04:36.066
Could you give me the key to Jinxiu Mountain Villa?

68
04:36.166 --> 04:37.242
I want to take another look.

69
04:37.266 --> 04:38.266
Ah.

70
04:39.900 --> 04:41.966
Since it's a gift from Mr. Ji,

71
04:42.000 --> 04:43.799
then the key must be with you.

72
04:43.823 --> 04:44.982
It's with me?

73
04:45.052 --> 04:46.052
Yeah.

74
04:47.333 --> 04:48.666
It's fine, Mr. Shen.

75
04:48.866 --> 04:49.866
You can look again.

76
04:50.466 --> 04:51.732
Once you've thought it over

77
04:51.733 --> 04:52.733
I'll come find you again.

78
04:54.500 --> 04:56.500
Then I'll take my leave, Mr. Shen.

79
04:56.533 --> 04:57.600
Let's keep in touch.

80
04:57.800 --> 04:58.300
Take care.

81
04:58.366 --> 04:59.366
Mm.

82
05:58.600 --> 06:01.333
My memories from three years ago are such a mess.

83
06:01.833 --> 06:03.433
Seems like not long after that

84
06:04.033 --> 06:05.866
the landlord kicked me out.

85
06:06.100 --> 06:07.900
Then Mr. Ji took me in.

86
06:07.933 --> 06:09.000
Signed a contract.

87
06:10.119 --> 06:11.986
So what's this house then?

88
06:12.833 --> 06:14.033
A down payment?

89
06:52.700 --> 06:54.166
How long until the plane flies?

90
06:55.466 --> 06:56.233
Plenty of time.

91
06:56.266 --> 06:57.266
We'll make it.

92
07:05.333 --> 07:06.900
This was once our home.

93
07:14.956 --> 07:19.703
(It's my fault, I'll make amends -Shen Mo)

94
07:28.000 --> 07:29.000
This guy.

95
07:30.000 --> 07:31.600
How many times have I told you?

96
07:32.000 --> 07:33.733
You can't even handle such a small thing.

97
07:34.000 --> 07:34.666
Sorry, boss

98
07:34.866 --> 07:36.200
I don't care what they say.

99
07:37.666 --> 07:39.366
We must win this project.

100
07:40.166 --> 07:41.166
No matter what.

101
07:41.533 --> 07:42.533
Understood, boss.

102
07:46.100 --> 07:47.233
Did you hear what I said?

103
07:47.333 --> 07:48.333
Excuse me.

104
07:55.900 --> 07:56.900
I'm so sorry.

105
07:57.900 --> 07:58.900
Did I bump into you?

106
08:00.900 --> 08:01.900
I'm fine.

107
08:02.066 --> 08:03.066
That's good.

108
08:04.433 --> 08:05.433
Ah.

109
08:05.500 --> 08:06.933
My art supplies I just bought...!

110
08:09.000 --> 08:10.165
Hey, don't laugh

111
08:10.189 --> 08:11.656
I was just trying to avoid you.

112
08:18.166 --> 08:20.200
Oh no.

113
08:22.800 --> 08:24.233
I scratched someone's car.

114
08:24.366 --> 08:26.033
How much is that gonna cost?

115
08:29.500 --> 08:33.566
This car looks pretty expensive.

116
08:37.200 --> 08:38.333
How expensive?

117
08:40.933 --> 08:42.400
The really expensive kind.

118
08:50.266 --> 08:51.533
What do I do now?

119
08:58.133 --> 08:59.133
Bro.

120
09:01.500 --> 09:03.133
Give me one too.

121
09:06.633 --> 09:07.633
Thanks, bro.

122
09:39.100 --> 09:42.700
You don't even smoke, why do you want one?

123
09:43.333 --> 09:45.166
Don't they say smoking eases your worries?

124
09:45.933 --> 09:47.200
Doesn't seem to help.

125
09:48.433 --> 09:49.433
Alright.

126
09:51.600 --> 09:52.600
Go home, quick.

127
09:54.033 --> 09:55.033
Hey.

128
09:55.100 --> 09:56.300
What do you mean by that?

129
09:56.726 --> 09:58.159
I, Shen Mo, may not have money,

130
09:58.366 --> 09:59.886
but I'm not that kind of person, okay?

131
10:01.200 --> 10:02.366
I won't run away.

132
10:04.466 --> 10:05.566
So what's your plan?

133
10:10.233 --> 10:11.233
Got a pen and paper?

134
10:24.370 --> 10:26.103
(It's my fault, I'll make amends -Shen Mo)

135
10:27.066 --> 10:28.066
Here you go.

136
10:31.100 --> 10:31.700
Ah.

137
10:31.701 --> 10:32.733
What bad luck.

138
10:35.665 --> 10:37.065
Can you help hold it?

139
10:39.033 --> 10:40.033
Thanks.

140
10:54.700 --> 10:55.700
What?

141
11:08.266 --> 11:09.266
I'm heading off then.

142
11:11.633 --> 11:13.033
Watch where you're going next time.

143
11:14.700 --> 11:15.700
Oh.

144
11:16.533 --> 11:17.533
I won't run.

145
11:18.333 --> 11:19.333
I'll pay you back.

146
11:42.500 --> 11:43.533
Shen Mo.

147
11:51.533 --> 11:52.533
Bro.

148
11:52.633 --> 11:53.633
An'an.

149
11:56.333 --> 11:57.100
Get in the car.

150
11:57.133 --> 11:58.166
Let's go eat.

151
11:58.266 --> 11:59.266
Okay.

152
11:59.433 --> 12:00.465
Did you see that just now?

153
12:00.466 --> 12:01.576
Some student, no idea what happened.

154
12:01.600 --> 12:02.765
All flustered.

155
12:02.766 --> 12:03.766
So ridiculous.

156
12:04.900 --> 12:05.633
I saw.

157
12:05.853 --> 12:06.853
That guy...

158
12:07.833 --> 12:08.833
his name is Shen Mo.

159
12:13.533 --> 12:14.533
An'an.

160
12:14.700 --> 12:15.600
You're graduating soon.

161
12:15.700 --> 12:16.766
What are your plans?

162
12:17.633 --> 12:18.633
Me?

163
12:19.233 --> 12:21.000
I want to go to the UK for grad school.

164
12:21.333 --> 12:23.166
My offer is coming any day now.

165
12:24.066 --> 12:25.133
Oh, that's easy.

166
12:29.100 --> 12:29.733
Bro.

167
12:29.900 --> 12:31.100
There's something else.

168
12:32.133 --> 12:33.133
Oh.

169
12:33.766 --> 12:37.366
I want to go to grad school with Zhou Yang.

170
12:40.466 --> 12:41.794
Zhou Yang, of The Zhou Family?

171
12:41.819 --> 12:42.819
Yeah.

172
12:43.766 --> 12:46.433
He's the only guy I've liked my whole life.

173
12:46.866 --> 12:47.666
Bro.

174
12:47.690 --> 12:50.024
Just say yes to us going to the UK together, please?

175
12:51.333 --> 12:53.173
Have you already talked it over with Zhou Yang?

176
12:53.610 --> 12:57.000
No, I just wanted to get your OK first, big bro.

177
12:59.100 --> 13:00.100
Mm.

178
13:00.700 --> 13:01.700
I see.

179
13:09.433 --> 13:11.166
I know what the Zhou Family is after.

180
13:11.266 --> 13:14.059
They've been wanting to meet you to talk about a business marriage.

181
13:14.259 --> 13:16.259
I don't care about business,

182
13:16.466 --> 13:19.300
I only care if Yang can make An'an happy.

183
13:20.233 --> 13:21.233
Understood.

184
13:22.200 --> 13:23.600
The key is Yang himself.

185
13:24.233 --> 13:25.600
Dig up everything on him.

186
13:25.933 --> 13:27.866
Who he's dealt with, what he's been up to.

187
13:29.133 --> 13:30.333
You know what I mean.

188
13:30.866 --> 13:32.333
Rest assured, Mr. Ji.

189
13:43.000 --> 13:45.865
Morning document review and key tasks for the day.

190
13:45.866 --> 13:47.332
Quarterly report on the offshore fund.

191
13:47.333 --> 13:49.266
Haiyue new energy project review meeting.

192
13:49.600 --> 13:49.833
Alright.

193
13:49.866 --> 13:50.266
Human resources...

194
13:50.833 --> 13:51.500
I got it.

195
13:51.500 --> 13:52.500
That's all.

196
13:53.066 --> 13:54.699
Also, the school leaders at T University

197
13:54.700 --> 13:56.366
invited you to their event again.

198
13:56.600 --> 13:58.120
Should I decline them again this time?

199
13:59.633 --> 14:00.633
T University?

200
14:03.000 --> 14:04.033
When is it?

201
14:04.600 --> 14:06.000
They said it's up to your schedule.

202
14:08.833 --> 14:10.433
If the timing works out...

203
14:11.833 --> 14:13.100
I could go.

204
14:14.066 --> 14:15.066
Okay.

205
14:38.000 --> 14:39.133
Not a good idea out here.

206
14:39.600 --> 14:40.366
What?

207
14:40.500 --> 14:41.533
Are you shy?

208
14:46.666 --> 14:47.266
Ah.

209
14:47.300 --> 14:48.300
What are you doing?

210
14:55.366 --> 14:56.466
Not out in public.

211
14:56.500 --> 14:57.800
What if someone sees us?

212
15:01.433 --> 15:02.433
Okay.

213
15:02.766 --> 15:05.733
You're the eldest son of the Zhou family, I know your identity is special.

214
15:13.233 --> 15:14.233
Xiao Mo.

215
15:15.600 --> 15:16.600
You're about to graduate.

216
15:17.833 --> 15:19.000
Any plans?

217
15:21.033 --> 15:22.366
Not sure yet.

218
15:22.900 --> 15:24.700
I definitely want to keep painting.

219
15:25.500 --> 15:27.933
But I've also sent out a few resumes.

220
15:28.086 --> 15:29.366
Just taking it one step at a time.

221
15:31.533 --> 15:32.533
Mm.

222
15:33.833 --> 15:35.233
Why are you asking all of a sudden?

223
15:37.733 --> 15:38.733
Nothing.

224
15:39.366 --> 15:40.166
No.

225
15:40.300 --> 15:41.300
Something's up.

226
15:41.533 --> 15:42.533
Spill it.

227
15:45.533 --> 15:46.533
Me?

228
15:46.766 --> 15:50.000
I'm just scared you'll be too busy for me later.

229
15:50.833 --> 15:51.900
Who knows?

230
15:53.466 --> 15:54.732
I'm such a great painter.

231
15:54.733 --> 15:56.633
One day I'll be a famous artist.

232
15:57.000 --> 15:58.633
You'd better start sucking up to me now.

233
15:59.933 --> 16:00.933
Okay.

234
16:01.000 --> 16:02.200
My great artist.

235
16:03.500 --> 16:04.500
Alright.

236
16:05.333 --> 16:06.066
It's getting late.

237
16:06.100 --> 16:07.366
We should head back to school.

238
16:09.200 --> 16:10.200
Let's go.

239
16:14.900 --> 16:16.600
Mr. Ji, you're truly a rising star

240
16:16.866 --> 16:17.733
I hope that in the future.

241
16:17.734 --> 16:20.233
The Ji Group can work more with our T University.

242
16:21.000 --> 16:22.000
You flatter me.

243
16:22.100 --> 16:23.300
T University is full of talent

244
16:23.633 --> 16:24.733
I also hope

245
16:25.333 --> 16:27.400
you'll send more talent our way to the Ji Group.

246
16:27.500 --> 16:28.500
That's for sure.

247
16:29.229 --> 16:32.041
[A very flattering headshot of Shen Mo featuring his various artistic accomplishments.]

248
16:32.065 --> 16:33.065
This is...?

249
16:34.300 --> 16:35.566
He's a good kid.

250
16:36.033 --> 16:36.966
Art major.

251
16:37.033 --> 16:38.433
His family's not well off.

252
16:38.666 --> 16:42.066
If he keeps painting, I can't say he'll be a great painter,

253
16:42.233 --> 16:44.066
but he'll definitely make a name for himself.

254
16:45.233 --> 16:46.600
Didn't expect him to be this good.

255
16:47.033 --> 16:48.333
You know Mo?

256
16:49.366 --> 16:50.366
No.

257
16:50.500 --> 16:51.500
Just happened to see him.

258
16:51.833 --> 16:52.833
Figured I'd ask.

259
16:53.466 --> 16:55.466
Want me to show you around campus some more?

260
16:56.300 --> 16:57.533
Thanks for the offer.

261
16:58.333 --> 16:59.566
I'll just look around myself.

262
16:59.833 --> 17:00.833
Mm.

263
17:58.259 --> 17:59.259
Xiao Mo.

264
17:59.733 --> 18:00.733
Zhou Yang.

265
18:13.726 --> 18:14.617
You must be hungry.

266
18:14.642 --> 18:15.642
Mm.

267
18:15.666 --> 18:16.533
Let's go eat.

268
18:16.566 --> 18:17.233
Okay.

269
18:17.266 --> 18:18.266
Let's go.

270
18:27.419 --> 18:28.852
They're classmates...

271
18:30.400 --> 18:31.100
Mr. Ji.

272
18:31.101 --> 18:32.581
I've looked into Zhou Yang thoroughly.

273
18:33.066 --> 18:34.066
He...

274
18:35.833 --> 18:36.833
Go ahead.

275
18:37.866 --> 18:39.200
He probably has a boyfriend.

276
18:39.833 --> 18:42.393
I also checked into his boyfriend's background while I was at it.

277
18:43.466 --> 18:44.746
Is he a student at T University?

278
18:45.266 --> 18:46.266
It's all in the file.

279
18:46.633 --> 18:47.633
Take a look.

280
19:16.533 --> 19:17.800
Contact the Zhou family.

281
19:18.700 --> 19:19.700
Okay.

282
19:21.700 --> 19:23.180
I'm going to meet with the Zhou family.

283
19:32.233 --> 19:33.233
Mr. Ji.

284
19:33.400 --> 19:34.633
The Zhou Family is here.

285
20:03.300 --> 20:04.300
Mr. Ji.

286
20:05.300 --> 20:06.300
Come, this way please.

287
20:20.066 --> 20:22.333
I heard Mr. Ji likes Tieguanyin tea.

288
20:22.632 --> 20:24.965
So I had someone especially get some top-grade Tieguanyin.

289
20:29.266 --> 20:30.866
It really is top-grade Tieguanyin.

290
20:31.833 --> 20:34.033
Then take some extra with you when you leave, Mr. Ji.

291
20:34.100 --> 20:36.133
We're family, no need for formalities.

292
20:36.300 --> 20:37.300
Uncle, Auntie.

293
20:37.533 --> 20:38.800
No need to be so polite.

294
20:39.733 --> 20:40.733
I'm the younger one here.

295
20:41.200 --> 20:42.433
Just call me Mingxuan.

296
20:42.666 --> 20:43.700
Alright then, Mingxuan.

297
20:43.900 --> 20:46.066
Then I'll get straight to it.

298
20:46.400 --> 20:48.533
About Yang and An'an studying abroad.

299
20:48.833 --> 20:50.565
Didn't we already agree on this?

300
20:50.566 --> 20:53.400
Why are you saying you need to think it over again?

301
20:54.700 --> 20:55.700
I think...

302
20:57.566 --> 20:59.166
it might not be a good idea.

303
21:01.000 --> 21:05.300
This Ji and Zhou family marriage was already agreed upon.

304
21:06.066 --> 21:07.766
What's not appropriate about it?

305
21:08.833 --> 21:11.493
You know well of An'an's condition.

306
21:17.500 --> 21:19.900
Our families aren't strangers.

307
21:20.466 --> 21:24.372
An'an's situation, your uncle and I know it all too well.

308
21:25.066 --> 21:27.800
Besides, it's not a big deal.

309
21:28.200 --> 21:30.566
We watched An'an grow up.

310
21:30.666 --> 21:33.733
Of course we'll be even more attentive in the future.

311
21:34.866 --> 21:36.000
Speaking of which.

312
21:36.833 --> 21:40.466
I was there for your father and mother's wedding.

313
21:41.700 --> 21:43.166
It was wonderful.

314
21:43.900 --> 21:48.059
Your father and mother's union was truly a beautiful tale in this city.

315
21:48.533 --> 21:51.800
We hope that Yang and An'an can be the same.

316
21:56.200 --> 21:57.200
Actually.

317
21:57.666 --> 22:00.899
An'an marrying Yang is the best choice.

318
22:00.900 --> 22:02.833
They know each other inside and out.

319
22:03.200 --> 22:05.733
You'd feel at ease too, wouldn't you?

320
22:06.233 --> 22:08.566
And you know.

321
22:08.659 --> 22:14.799
This is the best choice for the Zhou and Ji families.

322
22:16.406 --> 22:17.706
Even if An'an is fine with it,

323
22:18.779 --> 22:20.346
Yang might not be willing.

324
22:23.066 --> 22:24.066
Mingxuan.

325
22:24.500 --> 22:25.733
What do you mean by that?

326
22:26.666 --> 22:27.666
As far as I know...

327
22:28.633 --> 22:31.166
Yang is already seeing someone.

328
22:36.200 --> 22:37.100
Men, you know.

329
22:37.101 --> 22:40.100
Having a few girlfriends before marriage is normal, isn't it?

330
22:40.400 --> 22:41.900
It's just playing around

331
22:42.066 --> 22:45.000
I guarantee Yang will be loyal after marriage.

332
22:46.833 --> 22:49.700
Yang did date a girlfriend or two.

333
22:50.333 --> 22:51.866
But they've already broken up.

334
22:52.700 --> 22:53.833
This current one...

335
22:54.900 --> 22:56.400
I've never heard him mention it.

336
22:57.833 --> 22:59.066
He's changed his taste.

337
23:00.066 --> 23:01.133
He likes men.

338
23:01.633 --> 23:03.266
Of course he doesn't dare let you know.

339
23:06.500 --> 23:07.566
Mingxuan.

340
23:08.866 --> 23:11.200
So you had someone look into Zhou Yang.

341
23:11.633 --> 23:12.633
Of course.

342
23:13.466 --> 23:15.626
Of course I have to look out for my sister's happiness.

343
23:16.466 --> 23:17.466
Anyway.

344
23:18.766 --> 23:19.833
About going abroad...

345
23:21.266 --> 23:23.466
Uncle, Auntie, you should still ask Zhou Yang first

346
23:24.300 --> 23:25.500
before making a decision.

347
23:26.066 --> 23:26.766
Oh, come on.

348
23:27.066 --> 23:28.865
Zhou Yang won't have any objection.

349
23:28.866 --> 23:29.566
Mingxuan.

350
23:29.866 --> 23:30.866
Have you eaten yet?

351
23:31.100 --> 23:33.140
I'll have the maid cook you some of her best dishes.

352
23:34.100 --> 23:35.900
I appreciate the thought, Uncle.

353
23:36.333 --> 23:38.733
There's still a pile of things at the company waiting for me

354
23:39.000 --> 23:40.133
I really can't get away.

355
23:40.233 --> 23:41.466
Being busy is a good thing.

356
23:41.833 --> 23:42.966
We're all family now.

357
23:43.000 --> 23:44.433
Come by whenever you're free.

358
23:45.033 --> 23:45.833
I definitely will.

359
23:45.866 --> 23:46.733
Goodbye, Uncle, Auntie.

360
23:46.733 --> 23:47.566
Let me walk you out.

361
23:47.566 --> 23:48.200
Come.

362
23:48.233 --> 23:49.233
This way.

363
23:59.333 --> 24:04.166
Look into which slut is Yang fooling around with for me.

364
24:07.766 --> 24:09.666
It's all from your side of the family!

365
24:10.833 --> 24:11.833
Cut from the same cloth.

366
24:28.412 --> 24:29.645
How long has it been?

367
24:30.200 --> 24:31.900
Why hasn't the car paint been fixed yet?

368
24:32.633 --> 24:34.100
Sorry, Mr. Ji

369
24:34.233 --> 24:35.233
I'll go right now.

370
24:45.700 --> 24:47.900
Yang, we've lived together so long.

371
24:48.459 --> 24:50.026
How many times have you cleaned?

372
24:50.900 --> 24:51.900
Listen.

373
24:52.233 --> 24:54.000
You have to clean up with me from now on.

374
24:55.000 --> 24:56.866
Or I'll never cook your favorite food again.

375
24:59.000 --> 25:00.000
You hear me?

376
25:05.066 --> 25:06.066
Xiao Mo.

377
25:07.926 --> 25:08.693
What's wrong?

378
25:08.833 --> 25:10.033
You're holding something back.

379
25:12.100 --> 25:16.056
My... my family said they want me to study abroad.

380
25:17.300 --> 25:18.333
Which country?

381
25:20.400 --> 25:21.566
That's great news.

382
25:21.972 --> 25:23.172
Going abroad to study...

383
25:23.500 --> 25:24.700
I'd love that myself.

384
25:25.333 --> 25:26.333
It's just that I...

385
25:29.300 --> 25:30.300
Then you and I...

386
25:33.566 --> 25:34.566
Oh, come on.

387
25:35.066 --> 25:36.266
It's just a different country.

388
25:36.833 --> 25:38.553
But you're not allowed to find someone else.

389
25:38.866 --> 25:40.400
I'll be watching you like a hawk.

390
25:42.666 --> 25:44.333
I'm not that kind of person.

391
25:45.333 --> 25:49.066
I just feel bad I won't have time for you.

392
25:50.233 --> 25:51.666
School has breaks too.

393
25:51.900 --> 25:53.933
Just come back and see me on your breaks.

394
25:54.066 --> 25:54.733
Ah.

395
25:54.734 --> 25:56.066
Or I could go visit you.

396
25:56.566 --> 25:58.100
I've never even been abroad.

397
25:58.400 --> 25:59.400
Call it a vacation.

398
26:02.666 --> 26:03.133
Forget it.

399
26:03.666 --> 26:04.700
Let's drop it.

400
26:04.733 --> 26:06.066
Nothing's even set in stone yet.

401
26:10.333 --> 26:11.333
Exactly.

402
26:11.633 --> 26:13.393
Why worry about things that may never happen?

403
26:15.433 --> 26:16.673
It's not like you can run away.

404
26:18.133 --> 26:19.133
Yeah.

405
26:38.633 --> 26:39.300
What's up?

406
26:39.300 --> 26:40.300
You're so happy.

407
26:40.712 --> 26:41.712
First...

408
26:41.866 --> 26:43.133
I got my offer from the UK.

409
26:43.700 --> 26:44.700
Second.

410
26:44.933 --> 26:46.653
Zhou Yang agreed to come to the UK with me.

411
26:49.266 --> 26:50.266
Who told you that?

412
26:50.733 --> 26:51.533
Yang did.

413
26:51.733 --> 26:52.866
Yang told me.

414
26:53.233 --> 26:55.865
He said his parents already worked it out with you.

415
26:55.888 --> 26:56.888
Isn't that right?

416
26:57.493 --> 26:58.960
Yang agreed to go abroad too?

417
26:59.533 --> 27:00.566
Of course.

418
27:00.633 --> 27:02.233
Why else would he tell me?

419
27:04.533 --> 27:05.533
Come on, bro.

420
27:05.933 --> 27:08.233
Can't you just let us go to the UK together?

421
27:10.633 --> 27:11.966
You really like Yang that much?

422
27:12.500 --> 27:13.500
I do.

423
27:14.500 --> 27:18.133
You know that my whole life there's only ever been him.

424
27:19.459 --> 27:21.092
And if Yang doesn't like you back?

425
27:21.333 --> 27:22.573
Then I'll just keep liking him.

426
27:22.893 --> 27:24.026
As long as I get to see him,

427
27:24.066 --> 27:25.866
I'll be just so, so happy.

428
27:26.566 --> 27:29.433
You've got the Ji family curse.

429
27:30.266 --> 27:31.266
Lovesick fool.

430
27:34.133 --> 27:35.766
So you too, huh bro?

431
27:36.433 --> 27:37.633
I'm really curious.

432
27:37.893 --> 27:40.226
What kind of person could make you fall in love?

433
27:41.200 --> 27:43.933
If Zhou Yang and that Shen Mo are just playing around,

434
27:44.233 --> 27:45.833
and if he treats An'an well from now on,

435
27:46.733 --> 27:47.973
even if it's just humoring her,

436
27:48.433 --> 27:49.873
if he can keep it up for a lifetime,

437
27:50.340 --> 27:51.700
then it's not out of the question.

438
27:53.433 --> 27:54.433
Aw, bro.

439
27:54.633 --> 27:56.066
Are you gonna let us go or not?

440
27:56.400 --> 27:58.100
Please please please.

441
27:58.633 --> 27:59.633
Alright.

442
27:59.766 --> 28:01.000
It'll be just as you wish.

443
28:02.233 --> 28:03.233
Yay!

444
28:07.400 --> 28:08.400
An'an.

445
28:08.633 --> 28:09.673
My precious little sister.

446
28:10.466 --> 28:12.466
All you need to do is dress up pretty.

447
28:13.133 --> 28:15.133
And stay a princess in the castle forever.

448
28:16.033 --> 28:19.126
You don't need to worry about the storm outside.

449
28:27.933 --> 28:29.866
Yang agreed to go abroad with An'an.

450
28:30.866 --> 28:32.233
I was just about to report to you.

451
28:32.766 --> 28:34.800
I don't know why he suddenly gave in.

452
28:35.466 --> 28:37.900
Maybe your last visit to the Zhou Family worked.

453
28:38.733 --> 28:39.933
What did the Zhou Family do?

454
28:41.533 --> 28:42.733
That I don't know.

455
28:42.833 --> 28:44.432
But it looks like Yang

456
28:44.433 --> 28:46.233
must have broken up with that guy.

457
28:47.400 --> 28:48.400
Okay.

458
28:49.066 --> 28:50.186
Let's leave it here for now.

459
29:02.100 --> 29:02.633
Big Bro.

460
29:02.833 --> 29:04.733
Once I'm there, I'll miss you.

461
29:05.300 --> 29:06.766
If you miss me, just fly back.

462
29:07.133 --> 29:08.166
If it's too much hassle

463
29:08.233 --> 29:09.532
I'll fly over to you.

464
29:09.533 --> 29:10.233
Really?

465
29:10.266 --> 29:11.333
You said it.

466
29:17.633 --> 29:19.033
Take good care of An'an over there.

467
29:19.666 --> 29:20.666
I will.

468
29:21.066 --> 29:22.200
Don't worry, Bro.

469
29:22.766 --> 29:23.100
Mm.

470
29:23.700 --> 29:25.066
Then we're off.

471
29:25.466 --> 29:26.466
Mm.

472
29:27.300 --> 29:28.300
Let's go.

473
29:30.100 --> 29:31.100
Bye.

474
29:54.503 --> 29:56.503
[Shen Mo's dossier]

475
30:11.300 --> 30:12.300
Hello?

476
30:12.333 --> 30:13.066
Oh.

477
30:13.100 --> 30:14.100
It's me.

478
30:15.400 --> 30:17.133
That person you had me look into last time.

479
30:18.033 --> 30:19.433
Send someone to keep an eye on him.

480
30:19.933 --> 30:21.233
Is something wrong, Mr. Ji?

481
30:21.433 --> 30:21.766
Oh.

482
30:22.333 --> 30:23.333
Nothing major.

483
30:23.866 --> 30:25.066
Just watch him for a few days.

484
30:26.829 --> 30:28.683
[Assistant]

485
30:31.066 --> 30:31.866
Hello?

486
30:31.866 --> 30:32.500
What's wrong?

487
30:32.733 --> 30:33.733
Mr. Ji.

488
30:33.766 --> 30:35.686
The person you told me to watch has gone missing.

489
30:36.033 --> 30:37.066
When did that happen?

490
30:37.700 --> 30:39.409
I went to find him as soon as you gave the order.

491
30:39.433 --> 30:41.153
But I haven't been able to find him at all.

492
30:41.433 --> 30:42.466
What should we do now?

493
30:42.633 --> 30:43.633
What else can we do?

494
30:43.900 --> 30:45.066
Go find him, of course.

495
30:46.433 --> 30:47.566
Send more people to search.

496
30:48.133 --> 30:49.293
If that fails, call the cops.

497
30:49.566 --> 30:50.566
Yes.

498
30:56.300 --> 30:58.433
Yang just took Ji An'an abroad

499
30:59.000 --> 31:00.566
and now something's happened to Mo.

500
31:01.466 --> 31:02.966
Who else could've done it?

501
31:04.900 --> 31:05.900
The Zhou Family.

502
31:07.233 --> 31:08.500
You people are ruthless.

503
31:10.333 --> 31:11.333
But if...

504
31:12.433 --> 31:14.633
I never had anyone investigate Shen Mo...

505
31:40.333 --> 31:41.333
Hello?

506
31:41.466 --> 31:41.933
Mr. Ji.

507
31:42.233 --> 31:43.233
We found him.

508
32:13.000 --> 32:13.466
Mr. Ji.

509
32:13.733 --> 32:15.166
It might not look good inside.

510
32:20.233 --> 32:21.233
It doesn't matter
